---

SpireMentor started as a port of STS2BridgeMod by zhiyue
(https://github.com/zhiyue/sts2-rl-agent). Every part derived from it has
since been rewritten clean-room from a behavioural specification; no code from
it remains, and the exporter's donor-overlap gate checks that on every export.
